{
  "slug": "goodmem",
  "name": "Goodmem",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "GoodMem memory infrastructure for AI agents. Use Python SDK skills to write code that manages embedders, spaces, and memories, or use MCP tools to perform GoodMem operations directly via natural language.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `help` (Overview of all available GoodMem skills and what a user needs to get started), `java` (Use when the user wants to write Java code that interacts with GoodMem - creating embedders, spaces, memories,…), `mcp` (Workflow guide for GoodMem MCP server tools), `python` (Use when the user wants to write Python code that interacts with GoodMem — creating embedders, spaces, memories,…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `goodmem`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install goodmem@claude-community` from `PAIR-Systems-Inc/goodmem-claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
